# Copy to .env (or set in your host's build environment) once the site has a domain.
#
# VITE_SITE_URL pins the site's canonical origin. Leave it unset and every page
# self-references the host that served it — correct on localhost and on preview
# URLs, so nothing points at a domain that doesn't exist yet.
#
# Setting it does three things:
#   1. Canonical links and og:url point at this host from every deployment.
#   2. Open Graph / Twitter card images resolve against it.
#   3. `npm run build` generates public/sitemap.xml (skipped while unset).
#
# No trailing slash.
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://thebushboss.com
